Paragraph 3 describes the algorithm's execution process in detail, including its initialization with a small random sample from X, iterative search for an unhit range R, and termination after at most B iterations. This section is critical to understanding how the Budget-Aware algorithm works and contributes significantly to the main scientific contribution of the paper segment.

